title: "Steering Is Not Measurement: The Assistant Axis Shows No Clear Advantage as a Drift Monitor"
abstract: "Pre-registered test of the Assistant Axis as a persona-drift monitor on Qwen 3 32B: it separates judged drift, but shows no clear advantage over other persona directions or random directions."
